      "source": "Note that you can move an implementation of the deprecated [`constrainScroll(_:)`](nsclipview/constrainscroll(_:).md) to this method by adjusting the origin of `proposedBounds` (instead of using the `newOrigin` parameter in `-constrainScrollPoint:`).",
      "normalizedSource": "Note that you can move an implementation of the deprecated [`constrainScroll(_:)`](nsclipview/constrainscroll(_:).md) to this method by adjusting the origin of `proposedBounds` (instead of using the `newOrigin` parameter in `-constrainScrollPoint:`).",
